MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This update improves compatibility with the recent ggplot2 <https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html> update and also introduces functionality for fitted model objects created using the new rstanarm <https://cran.rstudio.com/web/packages/rstanarm/index.html> package. A few other minor notes are available on the GitHub release page <https://github.com/stan-dev/shinystan/releases>.

To install from CRAN:

install.packages("shinystan")

To install from GitHub:

if (!require("devtools")) install.packages("devtools")
devtools::install_github("stan-dev/shinystan", build_vignettes = TRUE)

